[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) is filed as one known issue. The reports merged into it have **two causes**.
This page sets out what the data shows, what we recommend and what has been done.

<Callout>
Not one issue, one fix. Two causes, two issues, two different outcomes.
</Callout>

## Observed facts

These come from the ticket export of 2026-10-04 and are computed at render time from the data in `src/lib/data`. The cause of a report comes from its tenant and form (`causes.ts`), not from the subject line or the intake tag.

<ProblemCounts ticket={4471} />

- **`parser` (the shared parser reads dates month first).** Every tenant on file writes the day first, so day and month come out flipped. Seen at all 11 tenants, from the app, email and the booking-v2 form.
- **`hint` (the booking-v3 form hint).** The form prints `MM/DD/YYYY` under the date field, so people at day-first tenants type month first. Seen only through the form at the three booking-v3 tenants: alder.physio, copper.studio and pale.harbour. This is a different bug with a different fix.
- **The five one-day reports** (R-41202, R-41209, R-41236, R-41344, R-41620) are listed in `desk-notes.json`. They say the day is off by one, not that month and day are flipped. The desk files them under `parser` by tenant, so they are **part of the 379**. They are not an extra count and not a third problem on this page. Their cause is unconfirmed; the reports mention time zones and clock handling.
- **Intake tags are a guess from the reporter's browser and disagree with the cause.** Some `parser` reports are tagged `hint`, and some `hint` reports are tagged `parser`.
- **Overlapping export pages.** The export has 427 rows with 15 repeated ids, so 412 unique reports.

<CauseTable ticket={4471} />

## Outcome of each cause

The export has no resolution data, so these dispositions are not in it. They are recorded here as they were given to us.

| cause | reports | issue | outcome |
|---|---|---|---|
| `parser` | 379 | [#1](https://github.com/apolesny/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1) | fixed; closed as completed |
| `hint` | 33 | [#2](https://github.com/apolesny/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2) | booking-v3 retired, so its form hint will not be fixed; closed as not planned |

The five one-day reports stay inside the parser's 379. They have no issue of their own.

## Recommendations

These are suggestions for the desk. Nobody has done them yet.

- Do not merge by subject alone during an incident (see [decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject)). Check the tenant and the way in.
- Change the status of [#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) from *known*. This page does not edit it, and it does not edit decision 0001.

## Completed actions

- One GitHub issue per cause was filed in the public repo for this page: #1 (parser) and #2 (hint). Each carries the desk's count from the table above.
- #1 was closed as completed and #2 as not planned, as set out in the outcome table.
- This page was added to the kb. No other page, and no decision record, was changed.

